{"video":"SdHOUYpt40g","lines":[{"t":[0,2.5],"en":"- Mommy, I can't find Waldo."},{"t":[2.5,4],"en":"- What, the circus?"},{"t":[4,5.5],"en":"He's behind the elephant."},{"t":[5.5,6.9],"en":"- Wow."},{"t":[6.9,9.2],"en":"So your child's a big fan of the Waldo books too."},{"t":[11.6,13.1],"en":"- Yeah, that's how I know."},{"t":[15.4,16.5],"en":"I'm Ross, by the way."},{"t":[16.5,17.6],"en":"- Hi, I'm Sally."},{"t":[17.6,18.6],"en":"- Hi."},{"t":[18.6,19.6],"en":"- So, no ring."},{"t":[19.6,22.5],"en":"Can I assume you're also a single parent?"},{"t":[22.5,24],"en":"- I am a single parent."},{"t":[25.1,26.5],"en":"- It's hard, isn't it?"},{"t":[26.5,28.4],"en":"There's almost no time for a social life."},{"t":[28.4,30.2],"en":"I mean, where are you gonna meet someone?"},{"t":[30.2,32.6],"en":"- Well, let's say, I don't know,"},{"t":[32.6,36.6],"en":"you met someone in the pediatrician's office."},{"t":[37.8,39.8],"en":"- Rossy, we're ready for you."},{"t":[48.3,49.5],"en":"- Um, yeah."},{"t":[52.3,54],"en":"Come on, Ross Junior."},{"t":[54,55.2],"en":"It's time to go in."},{"t":[57.7,65.7],"en":"- Mommy, Mommy, what's wrong with that man?"},{"t":[65.7,68],"en":"- Hey, I helped you find Waldo."}]}
